UID:80bf7bc6f700cefa8dac64090787dce4@montclairfilm.org
DESCRIPTION:Montclair Film's StorySlam is BACK. Each participant will have
  five minutes to relay their unique version of this month's theme. After p
 resenting to a supportive audience\, a team of judges will evaluate and sc
 ore each story.
